al automated review. \n                      95%+ of transactions match instantly with no manual work. \n                      Exceptions beyond your plan&lsquo;s included 1% cost $0.10 each for automated processing.\n                    ",[7855,8200],"\n                      Exceptions are the small fraction of transactions (typically less than 1%) that need additional automated review. \n                      95%+ of transactions match instantly with no manual work. \n                      Exceptions beyond your plan&#39;s included 1% cost $0.10 each for automated processing.\n                    ",[7855,8200],"\n                      Exceptions are the small fraction of transactions (typically less than 1%) that need additional automated review. \n                      95%+ of transactions match instantly with no manual work. \n                      Exceptions beyond your plan&rsquo;s included 1% cost $0.10 each for automated processing.\n                    ",[9605,9838],"\n                    Each plan includes a monthly reconciliation volume. If you exceed your plan&apos;s volume, \n                    you'll be prompted to upgrade. Volume resets monthly. Unused volume doesn't roll over.\n                  ",[9605,9838],"\n                    Each plan includes a monthly reconciliation volume. If you exceed your plan&lsquo;s volume, \n                    you'll be prompted to upgrade. Volume resets monthly. Unused volume doesn't roll over.\n                  ",[9605,9838],"\n                    Each plan includes a monthly reconciliation volume. If you exceed your plan&#39;s volume, \n                    you'll be prompted to upgrade. Volume resets monthly. Unused volume doesn't roll over.\n                  ",[9605,9838],"\n                    Each plan includes a monthly reconciliation volume. If you exceed your plan&rsquo;s volume, \n                    you'll be prompted to upgrade. Volume resets monthly. Unused volume doesn't roll over.\n                 